# Receta de NaranjOS — generada por naranjos-tanda-5c1.sh
pkgname=mako
pkgver=1.11.0
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc='Notificaciones del escritorio'
arch=('x86_64')
url='https://github.com/DYeicob/naranjos-recetas'
license=('custom')
depends=('cairo' 'pango' 'gdk-pixbuf2' 'glib2' 'wayland')
makedepends=('scdoc' 'wayland-protocols')
source=('https://github.com/emersion/mako/archive/v1.11.0/mako-1.11.0.tar.gz')
sha256sums=('72d11d3fca20a3dfbca0107ff875eace479751be0cf2ddd1dd5bafa131ac7282')
build()   { cd mako-$pkgver
  meson setup build --prefix=/usr --buildtype=plain -D sd-bus-provider=libsystemd -D icons=enabled -D man-pages=enabled
  meson compile -C build; }
package() { cd mako-$pkgver; DESTDIR="$pkgdir" meson install -C build; }
